    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>ALTERNATIVE 1 Recognition that at maximum displacement, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{T}=E_{E}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{E}_{E} = \\frac{1}{2} \\, k Δ {x}^{2}\"></span>; since <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Δ x = {x}_{0}\"></span>, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{T}=\\frac{1}{2}kx_{0}^{2}\"></span> ✓   ALTERNATIVE 2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega=\\frac{2\\pi}{T}=\\frac{2\\pi}{2\\pi\\sqrt{\\frac{m}{k}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{T}=\\frac{1}{2}m\\omega^{2}x_{0}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}^{2}x_{0}^{2}\"></span> ✓   ALTERNATIVE 3 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F=ma\"></span>; <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"kx_{0}=m\\omega^{2}x_{0}\"></span> to give <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k=m\\omega^{2}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E_{T}=\\frac{1}{2}m\\omega^{2}x_{0}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}kx_{0}^{2}\"></span> ✓</p>\n<p>In a first trial, the spring is compressed by 0.15 m, and the mass is released from rest.</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E=\\frac{1}{2}kx_{0}^{2}=0.524.50.15^{2}=0.2756=0.28 J\"></span> ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>Use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"{v}_{m a x} = ω {x}_{0}\"></span>   OR   <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{max}=\\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}}x_{0}\"></span>   OR   <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"KE_{max}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{max}^{2}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.4\"></span>   OR   <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span> ✓</p></section>"
